    <mj-spacer height="10px" />
    <mj-section
  background-color="#eff1f4"
  padding="1px 0.5px 1px 1px"
  border-radius="5px"
>
  <mj-column background-color="#fff" border-radius="5px" padding="0px">
    <mj-table
  css-class="new-heading-with-border"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
  width="100%"
  padding="16px 0px 12px 0px"
>
  <tr>
    <td
      valign="middle"
      style="
        width: 12%;
        font-size: 0;
        line-height: 0;
        padding: 0px;
        mso-line-height-rule: exactly;
      "
    >
      <div style="height: 0px; border-top: 4px solid #eeca66">&nbsp;</div>
    </td>
    <td
      valign="middle"
      style="padding: 0 8px; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap"
    >
      <span
        style="
          display: inline-block;
          font-weight: 900;
          font-size: 15px;
          line-height: 1.2;
          font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
          color: #000000;
          text-transform: uppercase;
        "
      >
        Spotlight
      </span>
    </td>
    <td
      valign="middle"
      style="
        width: 100%;
        font-size: 0;
        line-height: 0;
        padding: 0px;
        mso-line-height-rule: exactly;
      "
    >
      <div style="height: 0px; border-top: 4px solid #eeca66">&nbsp;</div>
    </td>
  </tr>
</mj-table>
    <mj-text
      padding="10px 12px"
      font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <h2
        style="
          font-size: 24px;
          line-height: 1.2;
          font-weight: 400;
          margin: 0;
        "
      >
        Little play festival
      </h2>
    </mj-text>

    <mj-image
      border-radius="10px"
      padding="10px 12px"
      width="600px"
      src="https://www.dubaisummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
      alt="REPLACE_ME"
      href="https://www.dubaisummary.com/"
      target="_blank"
    />

    <mj-text
      padding="10px 12px 16px 12px"
      font-family="Arial"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0">Short+Sweet Dubai is back, this time bigger, bolder, and bursting with energy. Experience a thrilling lineup of 10-minute plays spanning comedy, drama, romance, and unexpected twists, all in one fast-paced evening. With fresh talent, bold storytelling, and audience voting, every show feels alive and unpredictable.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0">From laugh-out-loud moments to gripping drama, it’s a vibrant celebration of theatre where every second counts and no two nights are ever the same. Whether you’re a theatre fan or just exploring, it delivers big entertainment in small, unforgettable bursts.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0">🔗 <strong>Link:</strong> <a style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;" href="https://dubai.platinumlist.net/event-tickets/105571/shortsweet-dubai-2026" target="_blank">Short+Sweet Dubai 2026</a><br />📅 <strong>When:</strong> April 18 to May 23<br />💸 <strong>Cost:</strong> Starts from 22.67 USD<br />📍 <strong>Where:</strong> New Covent Garden</p>
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>

    <mj-spacer height="10px" />
    <!-- keep your ad block exactly here -->
    <mj-section
      background-color="#eff1f4"
      padding="1px 0.5px 1px 1px"
      border-radius="5px"
    >
