        <strong>Nandagovindam Vishu Kaineettam 2026</strong>
      </p>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px">Celebrate Vishu, the Malayalam New Year, in an enchanting way as Kerala’s renowned musical ensemble Nandagovindam Bhajans brings an intimate, baithak-style bhajan evening to Dubai.</p>
      <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px">
              📅 <strong>When:</strong> <a
