      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px">Boris Grebenshchikov brings his first Dubai performance, blending legendary Russian rock classics with a fresh 2026 program. The concert promises a powerful, poetic, and deeply soulful live experience.</p>
